    "title": "Palmerton: Single-family home sells for $145,000 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Real Estate Newswire ,\n9 hours ago A 1,080-square-foot single-family house, built in 1900, has changed hands. The house at 622 Mauch Chunk Road in Palmerton was sold on May 1 for $145,000, or $134 per square foot. This single-story house has three bedrooms and one bathroom. The property is equipped with an oil heating system and central A/C. The property sits on a 5,070-square-foot lot. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
